<title>USA: GOLF-SCORES AT BAY HILL INVITATIONAL.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SCORES AT BAY HILL INVITATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Florida 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores at</p>
<p>the $1.5 million Bay Hill Invitational after the first round</p>
<p>at the 7,196-yard, par-72 Bay Hill Club on Thursday (players</p>
<p>U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>67 Paul Stankowski</p>
<p>68 Billy Andrade, Steve Jones, Tiger Woods, Fred Funk</p>
<p>69 Omar Uresti, Jay Don Blake, Chris Perry, Steve Pate, Payne</p>
<p>Stewart, Paul Goydos, Tom Kite, Vijay Singh (Fiji), Bernhard</p>
<p>Langer (Germany)</p>
<p>70 Len Mattiace, Naomichi &quot;Joe&quot; Ozaki (Japan), Ted Tryba,</p>
<p>Loren Roberts, Chip Beck, Nick Price (Zimbabwe), Tom Lehman,</p>
<p>Ernie Els (South Africa), Scott Gump, Stewart Cink, Jeff</p>
<p>Maggert, Scott Simpson, Greg Kraft, Brian Henninger, Tim</p>
<p>Herron, Guy Boros, Yoshinori Kaneko (Japan), Ian Woosman</p>
<p>(Britain), Skip Kendall, Robert Damron</p>
<p>Other non-U.S. players</p>
<p>71 Nick Faldo (Britain), Fulton Allem (South Africa), Grant</p>
<p>Waite (New Zealand)</p>
<p>72 Craig Parry (Australia), Wayne Grady (Australia)</p>
<p>73 Colin Montgomerie (Britain), Robert Allenby (Australia),</p>
<p>Stuart Appleby (Australia), David Frost (South Africa)</p>
<p>74 Steve Elkington (Australia)</p>
<p>75 Sandy Lyle (Britain)</p>
